# This repository is the pipeline, never anything it produces.
#
# Everything at the root is excluded by default and the source folders are added
# back by name. An allow-list rather than a deny-list, because a single stray
# sprite, thumbnail or catalogue database would put extracted third-party art
# into version control, and git history does not forget.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/LICENSE
!/assetlab/
!/rules/

# Per-build rule files name the build they were written for and carry vocabulary
# read out of its decompiled scripts. They stay on the machine; the repository
# ships the documented template instead.
/rules/*
!/rules/example.json

# ...and inside those folders, source only.
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.db
*.sqlite*
*.html
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.webp
*.ogg
*.wav
*.ttf
*.otf
*.zip
*.apk
*.apkm
*.xapk
